      <VERS vnumber="2">And it came to pass, as they <gr str="5265">journeyed </gr>from the <gr str="6924">east</gr>, that they <gr str="4672">found </gr>a <gr str="1237">plain </gr>in the <gr str="776">land </gr>of <gr str="8152">Shinar</gr>; and they <gr str="3427">dwelt </gr>there. <DIV>
