      <VERS vnumber="4">And they <gr str="559">said</gr>, <gr str="3051">come</gr>, let us <gr str="1129">build </gr>us a <gr str="5892">city </gr>and a <gr str="4026">tower</gr>, whose <gr str="7218">top </gr>
