      <VERS vnumber="5">And the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>came <gr str="3381">down </gr>to <gr str="7200">see </gr>the <gr str="5892">city </gr>and the <gr str="4026">tower</gr>, which the <gr str="1121">children </gr>of <gr str="120">men </gr>were <gr str="1129">building</gr>.</VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="6">And the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>
