      <VERS vnumber="7">
        <gr str="3051">Come</gr>, let us go <gr str="3381">down</gr>, and there <gr str="1101">confound </gr>their <gr str="8193">language</gr>, <gr str="834">that </gr>they may not <gr str="8085">understand </gr>
