      <VERS vnumber="8">So the <gr str="3068">LORD </gr>scattered them <gr str="6327">abroad </gr>from <gr str="8033">there </gr>upon the <gr str="6440">face </gr>of all the <gr str="776">earth</gr>: and they <gr str="2308">stopped </gr>
